port','text','The Craft Report',3,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:39:01'),(49,'global','Dark Showcase','dark-showcase.4','Paragraph: A monthly trade chronicle for luxury craftsme…','textarea','A monthly trade chronicle for luxury craftsmen. Designed with heavy technical typography, industrial detail sheets, and high-contrast ink-bleed photography.',4,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:39:01'),(111,'contact-us','Hero','hero.1','Image (hero.png)','image','assets/images/contact/hero.png',1,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(112,'contact-us','Form','form.1','Image (outline.png)','image','assets/images/contact/outline.png',11,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(113,'contact-us','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / Contact Us','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <span>Contact Us</span>',2,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(114,'contact-us','Hero','hero.3','Main heading: Let’s Start a Conversation.','html','Let’s Start a<br>Conversation.',3,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(115,'contact-us','Hero','hero.4','Paragraph: Tell us what you’re trying to build, improve,…','textarea','Tell us what you’re trying to build, improve, market or manage. We’ll understand your requirement, identify the right capabilities and connect you with the right team.',4,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(116,'contact-us','Hero','hero.5','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',6,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(117,'contact-us','Hero','hero.6','Button link: Start a Project','url','#contact-form',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(118,'contact-us','Hero','hero.7','Button text: Explore Our Services','text','Explore Our Services',8,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:39:01'),(119,'contact-us','Hero','hero.8','Button link: Explore Our Services','url','services.php',7,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:06:40'),(120,'contact-us','Form','form.2','Heading: Bring Us the Requirement. We’ll Bring the R