'2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(180,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.4','Bold label: Dedicated in-house design team','text','Dedicated in-house design team',4,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(181,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.5','Text: Focused on quality, consistency & on-time del…','text','Focused on quality, consistency &amp; on-time delivery.',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(182,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.6','Heading: Let\'s bring your magazine to life.','text','Let\'s bring your magazine to life.',6,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(183,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.7','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Tell us about your project.',7,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(184,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.8','Text: Subject','text','Subject',8,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(185,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.9','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',9,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(186,'magazine-design','Hero','hero.10','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',10,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(187,'magazine-design','Our Examples','our-examples.1','Heading: Our Examples','text','Our Examples',11,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(188,'magazine-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','Why Intelliworkz',12,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(189,'magazine-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Most design problems in publishing are not cr…','textarea','Most design problems in publishing are not creative problems. They are production problems: inconsistent output, missed deadlines, each issue that needs re-briefing, and source files that nobody can edit. We work differently. The same team handles your publication across every issue. Your grid, your typography, your cover format, and your brand rules are documented and followed from the first issue onward.',13,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(190,'magazine-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',15,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(191,'magazine-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',14,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(192,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.2','Heading: What Our Magazine Design Services Cover','html','What Our Magazine Design <br>Services Cover',16,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(193,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: We produce magazine covers, editorial layouts…','textarea','We produce magazine covers, editorial layouts, print editions, and digital publications. A four-page newsletter and a two-hundred-page annual magazine follow the same production sequence with only the scale of each stage differing.',17,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(194,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(195,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',18,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(196,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.6','Heading: Workflow','text','Workflow',21,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(197,'magazine-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.7','Paragraph: How a Magazine Issue Gets Designed','text','How a Magazine Issue Gets Designed',22,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(198,'magazine-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.2','Heading: what we offer','text','what we offer',23,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(199,'magazine-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.3','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Portt…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Porttitor egestas leo viverra nec consequat nunc sit cum pretium. Enim iaculis malesuada pharetra risus mattis. Convallis faucibus malesuada vitae pellentesque viverra sagittis. Sed vestibulum volutpat lacus a malesuada lorem dolor sagittis. Suspendisse vitae turpis a magna. Varius a sed a hac hendrerit.',24,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(200,'magazine-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.4','Heading: Book a Free Consultation','text','Book a Free Consultation',25,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(201,'magazine-design','FAQs','faqs.1','Heading: FAQs','text','FAQs',27,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:52:49'),(202,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.1','Image (hero.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/hero.png',1,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(203,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.2','Image (hero-decor.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/hero-decor.png',2,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(204,'manufacturing','Buyers Decide','buyers-decide.1','Image: Industrial engineering market… (collage.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/collage.png',14,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(205,'manufacturing','Dark: Built For Manufacturers','dark-built-for-manufacturers.1','Image (dark-decor-top.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/dark-decor-top.png',16,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(206,'manufacturing','Dark: Built For Manufacturers','dark-built-for-manufacturers.2','Image (dark-decor-bottom.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/dark-decor-bottom.png',17,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(207,'manufacturing','Dark: Built For Manufacturers','dark-built-for-manufacturers.3','Image: Industrial precision engineer… (showcase.png)','image','assets/images/manufacture/showcase.png',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(208,'manufacturing','What We Bring + CTA','what-we-bring-cta.1','Button text: Start a Conversation','text','Start a Conversation',28,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(209,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.3','Paragraph: Home / Industries / Manufacturing','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"industries\">Industries</a> / <span>Manufacturing</span>',3,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:06:40'),(210,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.4','Main heading: Great Manufacturing Deserves Greater Visibili…','text','Great Manufacturing Deserves Greater Visibility',4,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(211,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.5','Paragraph: Manufacturing businesses earn their reputatio…','textarea','Manufacturing businesses earn their reputation through what they produce, their process, their quality standards, and their clients. Communicating this to their ever increasing market at to the market, clearly and to the right buyers, is where most fall short. As a manufacturing marketing agency, Intelliworkz brings brand, creative, and digital capability built around how industrial businesses sell.',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(212,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.6','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',7,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(213,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.7','Button link: Start a Project','url','contact-us.php',6,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(214,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.8','Button text: Explore Our Services','text','Explore Our Services',9,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(215,'manufacturing','Hero','hero.9','Button link: Explore Our Services','url','services.php',8,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:06:40'),(216,'manufacturing','Buyers Decide','buyers-decide.2','Heading: Buyers Decide Before They Call','text','Buyers Decide Before They Call',10,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(217,'manufacturing','Buyers Decide','buyers-decide.3','Paragraph: The manufacturing sector has always been rela…','textarea','The manufacturing sector has always been relationship-driven. Referrals, trade shows, and long-standing distributor networks used to be enough. That is no longer the case. Today, a procurement manager researching suppliers starts online, comparing websites and reviewing capability statements before a conversation takes place.',11,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(218,'manufacturing','Buyers Decide','buyers-decide.4','Paragraph: At the same time, buyer expectations are risi…','textarea','At the same time, buyer expectations are rising. They want to see what you produce, understand the scale of your operation, verify your certifications, and get a sense of whether you are the kind of business they want to work with, all from your digital presence alone. Manufacturers who have invested in how they present themselves online are meeting that expectation.',12,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(219,'manufacturing','Buyers Decide','buyers-decide.5','Paragraph: The brands that grow in this environment are …','textarea','The brands that grow in this environment are not just operationally strong. They are visible, credible, and easy to evaluate, and they have built the marketing infrastructure to stay that way consistently.',13,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(220,'manufacturing','Where Manufacturers Lose Ground','where-manufacturers-lose-ground.1','Heading: Where Manufacturers Lose Ground','text','Where Manufacturers Lose Ground',15,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(221,'manufacturing','Dark: Built For Manufacturers','dark-built-for-manufacturers.4','Heading: Built for Manufacturers. Not Adapted for Them.','text','Built for Manufacturers. Not Adapted for Them.',18,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(222,'manufacturing','Dark: Built For Manufacturers','dark-built-for-manufacturers.5','Paragraph: We work as a dedicated manufacturing marketin…','textarea','We work as a dedicated manufacturing marketing agency. Every service is built around the buying behaviour and sales cycles specific to manufacturing.',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(223,'manufacturing','Who We Support','who-we-support.1','Heading: The Manufacturers We Support','text','The Manufacturers We Support',21,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(224,'manufacturing','Who We Support','who-we-support.2','Paragraph: We work with industrial goods and component m…','textarea','We work with industrial goods and component manufacturers, consumer product producers, contract and custom manufacturers, OEM suppliers, and assembly operations. Growing businesses building their market presence for the first time and established ones that have outgrown how they currently present themselves. The work is always shaped around your specific situation, not a generic manufacturing template.',22,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(225,'manufacturing','Who We Support','who-we-support.3','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',24,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:39:01'),(226,'manufacturing','Who We Support','who-we-support.4','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',23,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:18'),(227,'manufacturing','What We Bring + CTA','what-we-bring-cta.2','Heading: What We Bring','text','What We Bring',25,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(228,'manufacturing','What We Bring + CTA','what-we-bring-cta.3','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Portt…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Porttitor egestas leo viverra nec consequat nunc sit cum pretium. Enim iaculis malesuada pharetra risus mattis. Convallis faucibus malesuada vitae pellentesque viverra sagittis. Sed vestibulum volutpat lacus a malesuada lorem dolor sagittis. Suspendisse vitae turpis a magna. Varius a sed a hac hendrerit.',26,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:13'),(229,'manufacturing','What We Bring + CTA','what-we-bring-cta.4','Heading: Let the