e handle your collateral as one connected wh…','textarea','We handle your collateral as one connected whole. A brochure, a deck, and a proposal all shape the same impression, so we design them to hold together. When they do, your business looks confident at every step.',18,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(247,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: We bring that consistency by treating your br…','textarea','We bring that consistency by treating your brand as the starting point for everything we produce, then designing each piece. And because your teams move quickly, we build much of this material as templates they can own and reuse, so your brand stays intact long after we hand it over.',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(248,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Quote',21,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(249,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(250,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.2','Heading: Everything Your Brand Needs to Support Sales','text','Everything Your Brand Needs to Support Sales',23,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(251,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: We design the full range of material your mar…','textarea','We design the full range of material your marketing and sales teams use, all held to one standard and shaped around how your business sells. Take a single piece, or a complete set that shares one consistent look.',24,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(252,'marketing-sales-collaterals','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',26,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(253,'marketing-sales-colla