ervices ove… (services.png)','image','assets/images/packaging/services.png',29,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(263,'packaging-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1','Button text: Let’s Talk','text','Let’s Talk',36,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(264,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / Services / Branding & Creative / Packa…','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"services.php\">Services</a> / <a href=\"services.php#svc-1\">Branding &amp; Creative</a> / <span>Packaging design</span>',2,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-13 07:06:40'),(265,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.3','Main heading: PACKAGING DESIGN SERVICES','text','PACKAGING DESIGN SERVICES',3,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(266,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.4','Paragraph: Successful packaging goes beyond creative des…','textarea','Successful packaging goes beyond creative design. It requires artwork that is carefully adapted, technically accurate, and prepared for production, ensuring a smooth transition from concept to press. As a trusted packaging design company, we support that process from start to finish. Our packaging design services, Packaging Rollout, and Pre-Press services help brands and packaging printers manage packaging artwork across the entire production cycle. Whether it’s a new product launch or package redesign, multi-SKU graphics conversion or preflighting for printing, we will help ensure your projects stay true and on time. Using our creativity and understanding of production, we can help you streamline your process and save revisions along the way.',4,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(267,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.5','Bold label: Dedicated In-House Packaging Team','text','Dedicated In-House Packaging Team',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(268,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.6','Text: Creative and technical expertise focused on a…','text','Creative and technical expertise focused on accurate artwork, consistent branding and timely delivery.',6,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(269,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.7','Heading: Let’s Bring Your Packaging Vision to Life.','text','Let’s Bring Your Packaging Vision to Life.',7,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(270,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.8','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Tell us about your project.',8,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(271,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.9','Text: Subject','text','Subject',9,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(272,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.10','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',10,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(273,'packaging-design','Hero','hero.11','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',11,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(274,'packaging-design','Selected Work','selected-work.1','Heading: Selected Packaging Design Work','text','Selected Packaging Design Work',12,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(275,'packaging-design','Selected Work','selected-work.2','Paragraph: Explore packaging design, artwork adaptation …','textarea','Explore packaging design, artwork adaptation and production-ready packaging solutions created for brands and packaging printers. Our work covers custom boxes, product labels, packaging concepts, multi-SKU rollouts and artwork localisation, combining creative thinking with technical accuracy to maintain brand consistency across packaging formats.',13,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(276,'packaging-design','Selected Work','selected-work.3','Bold label: Lorem ipsum','text','Lorem ipsum',14,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(277,'packaging-design','Selected Work','selected-work.4','Text: Lorem ipsum dolor sit','text','Lorem ipsum dolor sit',15,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(278,'packaging-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Headi