d be easy to manage throughout the production process.',25,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(286,'packaging-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Paragraph: We combine creative thinking with a structure…','textarea','We combine creative thinking with a structured production process to help brands build packaging that\'s practical, consistent, and ready for production. As a product packaging design company, we help brands develop packaging that balances creativity, technical accuracy, and production readiness for a smooth transition to print.',26,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(287,'packaging-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',28,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(288,'packaging-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',27,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(289,'packaging-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.7','Heading: A Streamlined Workflow from Design to Press','text','A Streamlined Workflow from Design to Press',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(290,'packaging-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.8','Paragraph: Every packaging project follows a structured …','textarea','Every packaging project follows a structured process designed to support accuracy, consistency, and production readiness.',31,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(291,'packaging-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.2','Heading: what we offer','text','what we offer',33,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-12 04:56:14'),(292,'packaging-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.3','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Portt…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Porttitor egestas leo viverra nec consequat nunc sit cum pretium. Enim iaculis malesuada pharetra risus mattis. Convall