ows both sides of the search. Audit, strategy, on-page, technical work, content, link building:. We work alongside digita lmarketing teams to keep campaigns consistent and deliver efficiently.',21,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(389,'seo-services','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',23,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(390,'seo-services','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',22,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(391,'seo-services','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.2','Heading: OUR SEO EXPERTISE AND SERVICES','text','OUR SEO EXPERTISE AND SERVICES',25,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(392,'seo-services','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: Strategic Thinking. Technical Execution. Cons…','textarea','Strategic Thinking. Technical Execution. Consistent Search Growth.',26,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(393,'seo-services','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Paragraph: Our professional SEO services cover three dis…','textarea','Our professional SEO services cover three disciplines: technical SEO, on-page and content, and off-page authority. Run together, they form a complete programme rather than a handful of disconnected tactics.',27,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(394,'seo-services','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Paragraph: Rankings are the start, not the point. Search…','textarea','Rankings are the start, not the point. Search growth that lasts needs a solid technical base, content that genuinely earns its place, and authority built up slowly enough to hold. All of it is managed the same way in every market. That is the thinking behind our delivery, and it is why our programmes stay practical and scalable. It is also why marketing teams hand us the execution-heavy work they would rather not do themselves, everything from technical audits throu