00:57:40'),(656,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.6','Text: Focused on accuracy, realism & on-time delive…','text','Focused on accuracy, realism &amp; on-time delivery.',6,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(657,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.7','Heading: Let\'s bring your 3D vision to life.','text','Let\'s bring your 3D vision to life.',7,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(658,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.8','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Tell us about your project.',8,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(659,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.9','Text: Subject','text','Subject',9,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(660,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.10','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',10,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(661,'2-animaiton','Hero','hero.11','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',11,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(662,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.3','Heading: Selected 3D Modeling and Rendering Work','text','Selected 3D Modeling and Rendering Work',14,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(663,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.4','Text: Drag to Rotate ↔','text','Drag to Rotate &harr;',15,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(664,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.5','Sub-heading: Flexibel','text','Flexibel',16,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(665,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.6','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur.','text','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur.',17,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(666,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.7','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Conva…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Convallis sed dui netus suscipit quis. Porttitor ut egestas faucibus consectetur scelerisque magna. Orci adipiscing proin facilisis semper tortor viverra sed nulla duis. Ut eu.',18,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(667,'2-animaiton','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.8','Text: Exploded View','text','Exploded View',19,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(668,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','Why Intelliworkz',21,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(669,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: The value of a render is simple: people belie…','textarea','The value of a render is simple: people believe what they can see. A photorealistic image of a product lets a customer picture owning it, lets a stakeholder sign off on it with confidence, and lets your marketing and sales teams start work long before the product reaches a shelf.',22,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(670,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: Our team is involved in the entire workflow: …','textarea','Our team is involved in the entire workflow: setting up the model, all the way through to lighting the final image and finishing rendering; we provide a final result suited to its end purpose. For example, a pure studio shot for an online product directory would require very different lighting, composition, and finishing to a studio or scene designed for an advertising creative or a technical render suitable for a stakeholder.',23,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(671,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: Because everything is produced by our own tea…','textarea','Because everything is produced by our own team, your designs never leave our hands, which matters when you are rendering a product that has not yet launched. You get consistent quality across every image, and a team that already understands your product by the second project.',24,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(672,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',26,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(673,'2-animaiton','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',25,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(674,'2-animaiton','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.2','Heading: The Renders We Produce','text','The Renders We Produce',29,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(675,'2-animaiton','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: Our 3d product rendering services cover the v…','textarea','Our 3d product rendering services cover the visuals a business needs to sell, present and plan, from a single hero product shot to a full set of images for a catalogue, an online store or a campaign. Some clients send a finished 3D model ready to render; others send a CAD file or a set of drawings for us to model first. Either way, the finished images are built to match how and where you will use them.',30,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(676,'2-animaiton','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',32,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(677,'2-animaiton','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',31,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(678,'2-animaiton','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.2','Heading: what we offer','text','what we offer',35,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(679,'2-animaiton','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.3','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Portt…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Porttitor egestas leo viverra nec consequat nunc sit cum pretium. Enim iaculis malesuada pharetra risus mattis. Convallis faucibus malesuada vitae pellentesque viverra sagittis. Sed vestibulum volutpat lacus a malesuada lorem dolor sagittis. Suspendisse vitae turpis a magna. Varius a sed a hac hendrerit.',36,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(680,'2-animaiton','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.4','Heading: Book a Free Consultation','text','Book a Free Consultation',37,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(681,'2-animaiton','FAQs','faqs.1','Heading: FAQs','text','FAQs',39,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(682,'2-animaiton','Dark Showcase (shared)','dark-showcase-shared.1','Heading: What Our 3D Modeling and Rendering …','text','What Our 3D Modeling and Rendering Services Cover',34,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(683,'services','Hero','hero.1','Background image','image','assets/images/hero-bg.png',1,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(684,'services','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / Services','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <span>Services</span>',2,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(685,'services','Hero','hero.3','Main heading','text','Explore Our Services',3,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(686,'services','Hero','hero.4','Paragraph under the heading','textarea','Creative, digital and technology capabilities, brought together under one roof to help your business grow.',4,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(687,'services','Hero','hero.5','First button text','text','Start a Project',5,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(688,'services','Hero','hero.6','First button link','url','contact-us.php',6,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(689,'services','Hero','hero.7','Second button text','text','Talk to Our Team',7,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(690,'services','Hero','hero.8','Second button link','url','contact-us.php',8,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(691,'services','Hero','hero.9','Words at the right edge','html','Ideas<br>Design<br>Technology<br>Growth',9,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(693,'services','Call to action','cta.1','Small heading','text','Have a project in mind?',11,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(694,'services','Call to action','cta.2','Heading','text','Let\'s build it together.',12,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(695,'services','Call to action','cta.3','First button text','text','Start a Project',13,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(696,'services','Call to action','cta.4','First button link','url','contact-us.php',14,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(697,'services','Call to action','cta.5','Second button text','text','Discuss Your Requirements',15,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(698,'services','Call to action','cta.6','Second button link','url','contact-us.php',16,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 06:09:21'),(749,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.1','Background picture','image','assets/images/hero-bg.png',1,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(750,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / About Us','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <span>About Us</span>',2,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(751,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.3','Main heading (last line is red)','html','Your Extended Team for<br>Creative, Digital &amp;<br>Production Outsourcing',3,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(752,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.4','Paragraph under the heading','textarea','At Intelliworkz, we bring together creative talent, technical expertise and production capabilities to help businesses deliver more, scale faster and operate efficiently.',4,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(753,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.5','First button text','text','Start a Project',5,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(754,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.6','First button link','url','contact-us.php',6,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(755,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.7','Second button text','text','Our Services',7,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(756,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.8','Second button link','url','services.php',8,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(757,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.9','Words at the right edge','html','Creative<br>Digital<br>Production<br>Scale',9,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(758,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.1','Small heading','text','About Intelliworkz',10,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(759,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Built for Scale.<br>Designed for<br>Partnership.',11,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(760,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.3','First paragraph','textarea','We are a creative, digital and production services company building a strong global outsourcing practice for businesses that need reliable execution, consistent quality and the capacity to handle work at scale.<br><br>From creative design and video post-production to publishing, pre-press and print production, we help organisations streamline workflows, manage high-volume projects and extend their delivery capabilities without the cost and complexity of building larger in-house teams.<br><br>Our approach combines skilled professionals, structured workflows, quality-focused delivery and flexible engagement models to make outsourcing a seamless extension of your business.',12,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(761,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.4','Second paragraph','textarea','We believe outsourcing is more than delegating tasks. It is about building a dependable partnership that strengthens your operations and supports long-term growth.<br><br>Whether you need a dedicated team working alongside your organisation or a managed services partner to handle recurring production requirements, Intelliworkz offers the flexibility to adapt to your business needs.<br><br>We work with agencies, publishers, brands, production companies and enterprises that require dependable execution across large volumes of creative and production work. Our focus is on building lasting relationships through transparent communication, predictable delivery and the ability to scale with demand.',13,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(762,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.5','Button text','text','More About Us',14,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(763,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.6','Button link','url','#team',15,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(764,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.7','Big picture','image','assets/images/process-4.png',16,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(765,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.8','Small picture','image','assets/images/ind-realestate.png',17,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(766,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.9','Dark card: number','text','7+',18,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(767,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.10','Dark card: label','html','Countries<br>Global Presence',19,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(768,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.1','Small heading','text','Our Vision',20,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(769,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Dependable Partner<br>of Choice.',21,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(770,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.3','Paragraph','textarea','We endeavor to be a dependable partner of choice which provides creative, digital and production services, known for dependable delivery, scalable capabilities and enduring client partnerships.<br><br>We aim to help businesses across international markets achieve more by connecting them with the right talent, efficient production systems and flexible delivery models.',22,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(771,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.4','Big picture','image','assets/images/process-2.png',23,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(772,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.5','Picture bottom right (shown in black and white)','image','assets/images/process-3.png',24,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(773,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.1','Small heading','text','Our Capabilities',25,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(774,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Creative, Video &amp;<br>Production Expertise.',26,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(775,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.3','Paragraph','textarea','<strong>Creative Design &amp; Digital Production:</strong> From brand communication and marketing collateral to digital assets and campaign adaptations, we support businesses with consistent, high-quality creative output across channels and formats.<br><br><strong>Video Production &amp; Post-Production:</strong> We help production houses, agencies and brands manage editing backlogs, recurring video requirements and demanding delivery schedules through scalable post-production support.<br><br><strong>Publishing, Pre-press &amp; Print Production:</strong> We support publishers, content owners and print service providers with document production, layout and typesetting, artwork adaptation, pre-press preparation and print-ready file delivery.<br><br><strong>Industry-Focused Creative Support:</strong> We support manufacturing businesses with product catalogues and technical collateral; financial services with reports, presentations and investor communications; healthcare with educational and promotional materials; and real estate with project brochures, sales presentations and marketing assets.',27,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(776,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.4','Button text','text','Explore Our Services',28,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(777,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.5','Button link','url','services.php',29,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(778,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.6','Centre of the diagram','html','Your<br>Capability,<br>Extended.',30,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(779,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.1','Small heading','text','Why Intelliworkz',31,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(780,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Team Built Around<br>Your Business.',32,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(781,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.3','Paragraph','textarea','<strong>Integrated Capabilities:</strong> Creative, video, digital and production expertise within one operating environment.<br><br><strong>Scalable Delivery:</strong> The ability to expand capacity and capabilities as your requirements evolve.<br><br><strong>Transparent Engagements:</strong> Clear commercial terms and a practical approach to revisions, requests and ongoing support.<br><br><strong>Process-Driven Execution:</strong> Workflows built around quality, consistency, turnaround times and accountability.<br><br><strong>Long-Term Partnership:</strong> A team that works to understand your business, adapt to your requirements and contribute to your operational goals.',33,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(782,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.4','Button text','text','Explore Our Services',34,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(783,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.5','Button link','url','services.php',35,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(784,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.6','Big picture','image','assets/images/process-1.png',36,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(785,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.7','Picture top right','image','assets/images/process-6.png',37,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(786,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.8','Picture bottom right','image','assets/images/contact/hero.png',38,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(790,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.1','Small heading','text','Our Delivery Model',39,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(791,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Delivery Model<br>That Works for You.',40,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(792,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.3','Text at the right','textarea','Every business has different production demands. Our outsourcing models are designed to accommodate them.',41,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(793,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.1','Small heading','text','Our Commitment',42,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(794,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Intelliworkz —<br>Your Capability, Extended.',43,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(795,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.3','First button text','text','Start a Project',44,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(796,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.4','First button link','url','contact-us.php',45,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(797,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.5','Second button text','text','Talk to Our Team',46,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(798,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.6','Second button link','url','contact-us.php',47,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(799,'3d-modeling-rendering','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1.url','Button link: Let’s Talk','url','contact-us.php',39,'2026-10-13 07:06:39','2026-10-13 07:06:39'),(800,'global','Engagement Model','engagement-model.1.url','Button link: Let’s Collaborate','url','contact-us.php',2,'2026-10-13 07:06:39','2026-10-13 07:06:39'),(801,'index','Hero','hero.2.url','Button link: Start a Project','url','contact-us.php',6,'2026-10-13 07:06:39','2026-10-13 07:06:39'),(802,'index','Hero','hero.3.url','Button link: Explore Our Services','url','services.php',8,'2026-10-13 07:06:39','2026-10-13 07:06:39'),(803,'index','Domain Expertise','domain-expertise.1.url','Button link: About us','url','about-us.php',16,'2026-10-13 07:06:39','