','Pricing depends on deliverables, volume and turnaround. Share your brief for a quote based on your project scope.',39,'2026-10-13 07:39:05','2026-10-13 07:39:05'),(964,'3d-modeling-rendering','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.9','Text: Assembled View (button label after exploding)','text','Assembled View',19,'2026-10-23 03:32:49','2026-10-23 03:32:49'),(965,'3d-modeling-rendering','360 Viewer + Selected Work','360-viewer-selected-work.10','Text: Loading… (button label while the model loads)','text','Loading…',19,'2026-10-23 03:32:49','2026-10-23 03:32:49'),(966,'case-study','Hero','hero.1','Image (background pattern)','image','assets/icons/showcase-bg.svg',1,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(967,'case-study','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: breadcrumb','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"services.php\">Case Studies</a> / <span>Unified Conglomerate Brand</span>',2,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(968,'case-study','Hero','hero.3','Small label above the heading','text','Case Study | Diversified Conglomerate | Brand & Digital',3,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(969,'case-study','Hero','hero.4','Main heading','text','Building a Unified Conglomerate Brand Through Strategy, Branding & Digital',4,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(970,'case-study','Hero','hero.5','Intro paragraph','textarea','How a cohesive identity, corporate website and consistent content helped a UAE-based diversified business group communicate its scale, diversity, values and vision.',5,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(971,'case-study','Hero','hero.6','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',6,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(972,'case-study','Hero','hero.7','Button link: Start a Project','url','contact-us.php',7,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(973,'case-study','Hero','hero.8','Button text: Our Services','text','Our Services',8,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(974,'case-study','Hero','hero.9','Button link: Our Services','url','services.php',9,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(975,'case-study','Hero','hero.10','Heading of the client box','text','Client at a glance',10,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(976,'case-study','01 Industry Overview','overview.1','Number','text','01',11,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(977,'case-study','01 Industry Overview','overview.2','Section heading','text','Industry Overview',12,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(978,'case-study','01 Industry Overview','overview.3','Paragraph','textarea','A diversified UAE-based business conglomerate with interests across multiple industries and a growing network of businesses. With a diverse portfolio spanning services, the group needed a unified digital presence that could communicate its scale, diversity, values and vision while maintaining a consistent identity across every business vertical.',13,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(979,'case-study','01 Industry Overview','overview.4','Heading of the highlights list','text','Key highlights',14,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(980,'case-study','02 The Challenge','challenge.1','Number','text','02',15,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(981,'case-study','02 The Challenge','challenge.2','Section heading','text','The Challenge',16,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(982,'case-study','02 The Challenge','challenge.3','Intro line','text','Presenting many businesses as one group exposed five core barriers.',17,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(983,'case-study','03 The Approach','approach.1','Number','text','03',18,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(984,'case-study','03 The Approach','approach.2','Section heading','text','The Intelliworkz Approach',19,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(985,'case-study','03 The Approach','approach.3','Intro line','text','We brought every business under one brand, so the group\'s scale and vision came through in every touchpoint.',20,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(986,'case-study','04 Results & Brand Outcomes','results.1','Number','text','04',21,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(987,'case-study','04 Results & Brand Outcomes','results.2','Section heading','text','Results & Brand Outcomes',22,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(988,'case-study','04 Results & Brand Outcomes','results.3','Intro line','text','What the programme delivered for the group.',23,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(989,'case-study','05 The Impact','impact.1','Number','text','05',24,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(990,'case-study','05 The Impact','impact.2','Section heading','text','The Impact',25,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(991,'case-study','05 The Impact','impact.3','Impact statement','textarea','A unified brand and digital presence designed to communicate the group\'s scale, vision and diverse portfolio, bringing diverse businesses into focus.',26,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(992,'case-study','06 Services Delivered','services.1','Number','text','06',27,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(993,'case-study','06 Services Delivered','services.2','Section heading','text','Services Delivered',28,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(994,'case-study','06 Services Delivered','services.3','Heading of the capabilities strip','text','Capabilities applied',29,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(995,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.1','Heading','text','Want One Brand Across Every Business?',30,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(996,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.2','Paragraph','text','Tell us about your group and we will map out the identity, website and content it needs.',31,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(997,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.3','Button text','text','Start a Conversation',32,'2026-10-23