oes beyond a logo. It encompasses your colours, typography, imagery, and visual language that shape how your business is recognised and remembered. At Intelliworkz, we bring these elements together into a cohesive brand identity system, supported by clear brand guidelines and production-ready design assets. From websites and packaging to corporate stationery, marketing collateral, and digital communications, we ensure your brand remains consistent, distinctive, and professionally presented across every touchpoint.',4,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:55:00'),(1022,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.5','Bold label: Dedicated In-House Packaging Team','text','Dedicated In-House Team',5,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1023,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.6','Text: Creative and technical expertise focused on a…','text','We manage every stage of brand identity and design through a structured workflow—from initial concepts and feedback to refinements and final delivery—ensuring consistent quality, seamless coordination, and timely execution.',6,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1024,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.7','Heading: Let’s Bring Your Packaging Vision to Life.','text','Let&#039;s Collaborate to build Your Brand identity',7,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1025,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.8','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','We would love to know your brand journey till now and partner to define the present and future',8,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1026,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.9','Text: Subject','text','Subject',9,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1027,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.10','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',10,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1028,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.11','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',11,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23