 SERVICES','text','Every Layer of Your Brand Identity',25,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1131,'logo-design~services-scse','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: Strategic Thinking. Technical Execution. Cons…','textarea','We deliver end-to-end branding solutions, from initial research and brand strategy to visual identity development, brand guidelines, and production-ready assets for everyday business use. Whether you need a complete brand identity or support with specific elements, our services adapt to your requirements, filling the gaps while ensuring consistency across every brand touchpoint',26,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1132,'logo-design~services-scse','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Paragraph: Our professional SEO services cover three dis…','textarea','',27,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1133,'logo-design~services-scse','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Paragraph: Rankings are the start, not the point. Search…','textarea','',28,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1134,'logo-design~services-scse','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.6','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',30,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1135,'logo-design~services-scse','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.7','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',29,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(1136,'logo-design~why-vopx','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','We Design More Than a Graphic',12,'2026-10-23 06:24:20','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1137,'logo-design~why-vopx','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Most design problems in publishing are not cr…','textarea','A strong brand identity starts with a well-designed logo and a clearly defined set of brand guidelines that ensure consistency across every application. At Intelliworkz, we support the process from logo development and brand guideline creation to preparing production-ready vector files in formats such as AI, EPS, SVG, and print-ready PDF. These scalable, adaptable assets enable corporate branding agencies to reproduce logos accurately across business cards, letterheads, envelopes, corporate stationery, signage, merchandise, and other branded materials. Whether you’re building a brand from the ground up or need reliable artwork production support for multiple corporate clients, we help ensure every asset is consistent, versatile, and ready for use across print and digital applications.',13,'2026-10-23 06:24:20','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1138,'logo-design~why-vopx','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Get a Free Logo Consultation',15,'2026-10-23 06:24:20','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1139,'logo-design~why-vopx','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',14,'2026-10-23 06:24:20','2026-10-23 06:24:20'),(1140,'logo-design~why-vopx','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',16,'2026-10-23 06:24:20','2026-10-23 06:24:20'),(1141,'marketing-sales-collaterals~stats-nzja','Stats','stats.1','Image (stats-bg-1.png)','image','assets/images/video/stats-bg-1.png',17,'2026-10-23 23:38:15','2026-10-23 23:38:15'),(1142,'marketing-sales-collaterals~stats-nzja','Stats','stats.2','Image (stats-bg-2.png)','image','assets/images/video/stats-bg-2.png',18,'2026-10-23 23:38:15','2026-10-23 23:38:15'),(1143,'marketing-sales-collaterals~stats-nzja','Stats','stats.3','Image (stats-bg-3.png)','image','assets/images/video/stats-bg-3.png',19,'2026-10-23 23:38:15','2026-10-23 23:38:15'),(1144,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','Why Intelliworkz',20,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1145,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Most presentations fail for the same reason: …','textarea','Most presentations fail for the same reason: there is too much on every slide, and no clear point for the audience to follow. The information is all there, but it is buried under long bullet lists, dense text, and charts that are hard to read. The audience ends up reading the slide instead of listening to you. We fix this by designing around your message first, then making each slide simple to read and simple to present from.',21,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1146,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: We start with your content and your goal, whe…','textarea','We start with your content and your goal, whether that is winning an investment, closing a sale, or bringing a team together. We then put the story in a clear order, cut each slide down to the one point it needs to make, and design it to match your brand. Dense data becomes simple charts, heavy text becomes short and clear lines, and the deck is easy for an audience to follow.',22,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1147,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…','textarea','As a branding partner, we also make sure your presentation matches the rest of your business. The colours, fonts and style follow your brand, so every deck looks like it belongs to your company.',23,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1148,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',25,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1149,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',24,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1150,'marketing-sales-collaterals~why-jwkg','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',27,'2026-10-23 23:39:44','2026-10-23 23:39:44'),(1151,'marketing-sales-collaterals~tools-q8lj','Tools Strip','tools-strip.1','Image (tools-bg.png)','image','assets/images/ppt/tools-bg.png',26,'2026-10-23 23:40:21','2026-10-23 23:40:21'),(1152,'marketing-sales-collaterals~services-cqqg','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.1','Image: Video editing services overvi… (services.png)','image','assets/images/video/services.png',29,'2026-10-23 23:41:44','2026-10-23 23:41:44'),(1153,'marketing-sales-collaterals~services-cqqg','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.2','Heading: What Our Video Editing Services Cover','text','What Our Video Editing Services Cover',25,'2026-10-23 23:41:44','2026-10-23 23:41:44'),(1154,'marketing-sales-collaterals~services-cqqg','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.3','Paragraph: We work across corporate brand films, commerc…','textarea','We work across corporate brand films, commercials, product videos, documentaries, training content, event coverage and short-form social content. Finishing work is part of the scope rather than quoted separately.',26,'2026-10-23 23:41:44','2026-10-23 23:41:44'),(1155,'marketing-sales-collaterals~services-cqqg','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',28,'2026-10-23 23:41:44','2026-10-23 23:41:44'),(1156,'marketing-sales-collaterals~services-cqqg','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',27,'2026-10-23 23:41:44','2026-10-23 23:41:44');
