FFF\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"Dedicated project team\",\"text\":\"The same team works on your project from start to finish. Your standards and feedback are carried forward.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-3.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FC 0%, #FFFFFF 100%), #F5F5F5\",\"x\":56,\"title\":\"Secure your content\",\"text\":\"Your footage, files and unpublished material are handled under strict security protocols.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-4-68b7aa.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"bg\":\"#FEFEFE\",\"x\":77.82,\"title\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"text\":\"All video editing work is quoted clearly in advance. No hidden costs, no surprises.\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(112,'video-editing','ve_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-premiere.png\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Edit | Assemble\"],[\"tool-aftereffects.png\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Composite\"],[\"tool-finalcut.png\",\"Final Cut Pro\",\"Edit | Deliver\"],[\"tool-davinci.png\",\"DaVinci Resolve\",\"Grade | Finish\"],[\"tool-audition.png\",\"Adobe Audition\",\"Clean | Mix\"],[\"tool-frameio-1658d8.png\",\"Frame.io\",\"Review | Approve\"]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(113,'video-editing','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Editing and Assembly\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Footage review, take selection, and story structure\",\"Multi-camera synchronisation\",\"Rough Cut\",\"Pacing, sequencing, and narrative construction\",\"Audio Sync\"]},{\"title\":\"Finishing and Post\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Colour grading\",\"Audio cleanup and sound design\",\"Motion graphics and VFX\",\"Subtitling and captions\",\"Platform-specific exports\"]},{\"title\":\"Digital Magazine Design\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Corporate brand films\",\"Commercials\",\"Product videos\",\"Documentaries\",\"Training content\",\"Event coverage\",\"Short-form social content\"]}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(114,'video-editing','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-art-1.png\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Brief and Goal\",\"We start by agreeing on what the video is for, who it is for, and where it will be shown. Everything after this follows from it.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-art-2.png\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Footage Review\",\"We go through all your raw footage, pick the best material, and plan the edit before we start.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-art-3.png\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"First Cut\",\"We put together the first version so you can see the structure and pacing early.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Refinement\",\"We add color grading, sound, motion graphics, and final timing to complete the video.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Final Delivery\",\"We export the video in every resolution and aspect ratio you need, ready for each platform.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Your Review\",\"You share your feedback, and we make the changes for as many rounds as you need.\"]]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(115,'video-editing','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"From animated logos and lower thirds to full-sequence motion design, we create graphics that bring energy, clarity, and brand consistency to every frame.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We distil complex ideas into clear, engaging narratives using a mix of live action, animation, and motion graphics tailored to your audience and platform.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"Showcase your product with polished visuals, precise pacing, and platform-ready edits designed to drive engagement and conversion across every channel.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Event Films\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"Complete coverage of conferences, launches and live events, edited into highlight reels, recaps and social-ready clips.\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(116,'video-editing','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What video editing services do professional video editing companies offer?\",\"Editing and assembly, colour grading, audio, motion graphics, subtitling, and platform-ready exports.\"],[\"What are the different types of video editing?\",\"Corporate brand films, commercials, product videos, documentaries, training content, event coverage and short-form social content.\"],[\"What video editing software do you use?\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro, Adobe After Effects, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Adobe Audition and Frame.io.\"],[\"How long does the editing process take?\",\"Turnaround is confirmed upfront, based on the length and complexity of the video and the delivery date you have agreed on.\"],[\"What is included in video post-production services?\",\"Finishing work is part of the scope rather than quoted separately: colour grading, sound, motion graphics, subtitling and final exports.\"],[\"How do you handle feedback, revisions, and creative direction?\",\"You share your feedback, and we make the changes for as many rounds as you need.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(117,'global','offices','Offices','Office cards in the footer','[{\"flag\":\"flag-india.svg\",\"map\":\"map-india.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".4\",\"name\":\"India\",\"address\":\"Block-B, B912-A, World Trade Tower, Nr. BMW Showroom, SG Highway, Ahmedabad - 380051 Gujarat - India.\",\"phone\":\"+91 92740 02997 , +91 92740 02997\"},{\"flag\":\"flag-usa.svg\",\"map\":\"map-usa-35ebcb.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".4\",\"name\":\"USA\",\"address\":\"5511, Mercier Street,<br>Lewis Center, <br>Ohio 43035\",\"phone\":\"+1 614 999 2286\"},{\"flag\":\"flag-dubai.svg\",\"map\":\"map-dubai.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".5\",\"name\":\"Dubai\",\"address\":\"Office No. 25, 13th Floor, Al Saqar Business Tower, Nr. Future Museum, Sheikh Zayed Road, Dubai, UAE.\",\"phone\":\"+971 56 343 5362\"}]',1,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(174,'2-animaiton','td_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Precision-Driven 3D Modeling\",\"Photorealistic Rendering\",\"Production-Ready 3D Assets\",\"Flexible 3D Workflows\"]',5,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(175,'2-animaiton','td_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"wireframe\":\"Wireframe\",\"material\":\"Material Study\",\"detail\":\"Detail View\",\"360\":\"360\\u00b0 View\",\"exploded\":\"Exploded View\"}',19,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(176,'2-animaiton','td_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"gallery-1.png\",\"cats\":\"detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-2.png\",\"cats\":\"wireframe detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-3.png\",\"cats\":\"wireframe\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-4.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-5.png\",\"cats\":\"material detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-featured-4b403a.png\",\"cats\":\"360 exploded\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-6.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-7.png\",\"cats\":\"detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-8.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-9.png\",\"cats\":\"exploded\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-10.png\",\"cats\":\"exploded detail\"}]',20,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(177,'2-animaiton','td_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(178,'2-animaiton','td_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(179,'2-animaiton','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"In-house 3D Team\",\"text\":\"All 3D modeling and rendering work is handled by our in-house team for consistent quality, control, and communication.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Dedicated project team\",\"text\":\"The same 3D artist or team works on your project from start to finish, carrying your materials, lighting, and quality standards forward without re-briefing.\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Data security\",\"text\":\"Your content, files, and unpublished material are handled under strict security, kept within our team and never shared outside.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"text\":\"All design work produced entirely in-house: no freelancers, no subcontracting.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(180,'2-animaiton','td_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-vray.svg\",\"V-Ray and Corona\",\"Realistic Rendering\"],[\"tool-blender.svg\",\"Blender and Cycles\",\"Creative Flexibility\"],[\"tool-3dsmax.png\",\"3ds Max\",\"Precision Modelling\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Post Production\"]]',50,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(181,'2-animaiton','td_tool_formats_label','Tools','Formats label','[\"CAD and model formats\",\"Works with Your Pipeline\"]',51,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(182,'2-animaiton','td_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Product Rendering\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Studio-style product images for catalogues and eCommerce\",\"Lifestyle and in-context scenes that show the product in use\",\"Material, colour and finish variations from a single model\",\"Exploded views and close-up detail shots for technical clarity\"]},{\"title\":\"Commercial and Marketing\",\"points\":[\"Hero shots and campaign imagery built around your brand\",\"Consistent visuals across product ranges\",\"Assets sized and formatted for every channel\"]},{\"title\":\"Architectural and Interior\",\"points\":[\"Interior and exterior visualisations for approval and marketing\",\"Material and lighting studies for a space\",\"Walkthrough-ready scenes for presentations\"]}]',60,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(183,'2-animaiton','td_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1-160f4f.png\",\"title\":\"Your files.\",\"text\":\"You send a 3D model, a CAD file, or drawings. If you only have drawings, we build the model first. If the model is ready, we move straight to the scene, and we confirm how the images will be used.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2-51cdb9.png\",\"title\":\"Materials and lighting.\",\"text\":\"We apply accurate materials, colours and finishes to match the real product, then light the scene to suit the setting you want, from a clean studio background to a real-world environment.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"title\":\"Draft render.\",\"text\":\"You see a first version at working quality, so you can check the angle, materials and composition before we commit to the final output. Catching a change here saves time later.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4-293cbb.png\",\"title\":\"Review and adjust.\",\"text\":\"You give feedback on the draft, and we refine the materials, lighting, and framing within the agreed rounds. Changes at this stage are quick and inexpensive to make.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5-3348cf.png\",\"title\":\"Final delivery.\",\"text\":\"We render at full resolution, finish each image in post-production, and deliver the files in the sizes and formats you need for print, web, eCommerce, or presentation.\"}]',70,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(184,'2-animaiton','td_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Demo Videos\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Show how your product works through clear demonstrations created with accurate 3D models and rendered scenes.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"3D Animation\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"Bring products, mechanisms and concepts to life with animated sequences that explain movement, assembly and function.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Visual merchandise\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"Create polished retail and campaign visuals that present products across displays, environments and promotional formats.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Technical Renders\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Precise technical visuals for stakeholders and manufacturing partners, built directly from your CAD data.\"}]',80,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(185,'2-animaiton','td_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is 3D rendering?\",\"3D rendering is where we produce a photorealistic image or video of a 3D model. Software can add textures to it, a degree of lighting, plus minute details to complete the vision, which will look very real; almost photorealistic. Often used to visualize what an object, a space, or a building will look like before it is even built so that sales can take place in advance.\\nbold text\"],[\"Is 3D rendering difficult?\",\"The process itself takes specialist software and an experienced team, but for you it is straightforward: you send a model or drawings, review a draft, and give feedback within the agreed rounds.\"],[\"Will AI replace 3D rendering?\",\"AI tools can speed up parts of the process, but accurate materials, lighting, and finishing for a specific product or brand still need an experienced in-house team to get right.\"],[\"What software is best for 3D rendering?\",\"We work with V-Ray and Corona for realistic rendering, Blender and Cycles for creative flexibility, and 3ds Max for precision modelling, chosen to suit each project.\"],[\"Why should you use 3D rendering for your business?\",\"A photorealistic image lets a customer picture owning the product, lets a stakeholder sign off with confidence, and lets your marketing and sales teams start work before the product reaches a shelf.\"],[\"What is included in your 3D rendering services?\",\"Model preparation, materials and lighting, a draft render for review, refinement within the agreed rounds, and final delivery in the sizes and formats you need.\"]]',90,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 01:00:16'),(186,'services','svc_sections','Service Groups','Service groups','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Branding & Creative\",\"tag\":\"Branding & Creative\",\"title\":\"Build a brand people remember.\",\"text\":\"From brand foundations to digital experiences, we create identities and communication systems that connect with your audience and support your business goals.\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/collaterals\\/hero.png\",\"c\":\"var(--c-blue)\",\"ico\":\"icon-briefcase.svg\",\"cols\":2,\"layout\":\"rows\",\"items\":[\"Logo Design | logo-design\",\"Brand Identity & Design\",\"Marketing & Sales Collaterals | marketing-sales-collaterals.php\",\"Packaging Design | packaging-design.php\",\"Campaign Concepts & Ad Creatives\",\"Corporate Communication\",\"Visual Identity Systems\",\"PPT Design | ppt-design.php\",\"Advertising Services\",\"UI\\/UX Design\"]},{\"no\":\"02\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Digital Marketing & Growth\",\"tag\":\"Digital Marketing & Growth\",\"title\":\"Turn visibility into growth.\",\"text\":\"Data-driven digital marketing to help you reach the right audience, generate demand and grow your business online.\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/outsource-marketing.png\",\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"ico\":\"card-chart.svg\",\"cols\":2,\"layout\":\"rows\",\"items\":[\"Digital Marketing\",\"SEO Services | seo-services.php\",\"AEO Services\",\"GEO Services\"]},{\"no\":\"03\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Print & Publication\",\"tag\":\"Print & Publication\",\"title\":\"Precision in every publication.\",\"text\":\"Print-ready artwork, publishing and editorial production for high-quality business and academic communication.\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/outsource-creative.png\",\"c\":\"var(--c-purple)\",\"ico\":\"card-clipboard.svg\",\"cols\":4,\"layout\":\"cards\",\"items\":[\"Pre-Press Services | pre-press-service.php\",\"Magazine Design | magazine-design.php\",\"Academic & Technical Publishing Support\",\"Multilingual Publishing & Localization\",\"Product Catalog\",\"InDesign Services\",\"Newsletter Design\"]},{\"no\":\"04\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Post-Production\",\"tag\":\"Post-Production\",\"title\":\"Make every visual count.\",\"text\":\"Refine footage, imagery and motion assets for polished, production-ready communication.\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/video\\/pf-base-19393f.png\",\"c\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"ico\":\"card-check.svg\",\"cols\":3,\"layout\":\"cards\",\"items\":[\"Video Editing | video-editing.php\",\"Image Editing\",\"Motion Graphics\",\"Explainer Videos\",\"Product Video\",\"Social Media Reels\"]},{\"no\":\"05\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Animation\",\"tag\":\"Animation\",\"title\":\"Bring ideas to life.\",\"text\":\"Create engaging motion-led experiences, product demonstrations and 3D visuals for every platform.\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/3d\\/hero-floor.png\",\"c\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"ico\":\"icon-globe.svg\",\"cols\":3,\"layout\":\"cards\",\"items\":[\"Product Demo Videos\",\"Corporate Videos & Shoots\",\"Presentation Videos\",\"3D Modelling & 3D Rendering | 3d-modeling-rendering.php\",\"3D Visualization (Product \\/ Architectural \\/ Industrial)\",\"3D Animation\"]}]',20,'2026-10-13 06:09:21','2026-10-13 07:41:16'),(191,'about-us','ab_metrics','Numbers','Number strip','[{\"icon\":\"icon-send.svg\",\"value\":\"2500\",\"label\":\"Projects Delivered\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-globe.svg\",\"value\":\"7\",\"label\":\"Countries Global Presence\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-briefcase.svg\",\"value\":\"30\",\"label\":\"Industries Served\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-clock.svg\",\"value\":\"18\",\"label\":\"Years of Experience\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-users.svg\",\"value\":\"1200\",\"label\":\"Global Clients\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-users.svg\",\"value\":\"120\",\"label\":\"Skilled Professionals\"}]',5,'2026-10-13 06:54:51','2026-10-13 06:54:51'),(192,'about-us','ab_purpose','04 Our Purpose','Purpose points','[{\"icon\":\"icon-briefcase.svg\",\"title\":\"Quality & Efficiency\",\"text\":\"Measurable value through quality and efficiency.\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-clock.svg\",\"title\":\"Flexibility\",\"text\":\"A partner capable of handling complexity and managing volume.\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-users.svg\",\"title\":\"Trust\",\"text\":\"Growing alongside you as we expand into global markets.\"}]',10,'2026-10-13 06:54:51','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(193,'about-us','ab_nodes','05 Our Approach','Capability circles around the centre','[{\"label\":\"Creative Design\",\"icon\":\"icon-briefcase.svg\"},{\"label\":\"Digital Production\",\"icon\":\"icon-send.svg\"},{\"label\":\"Video Production\",\"icon\":\"icon-users.svg\"},{\"label\":\"Post-Production\",\"icon\":\"icon-clock.svg\"},{\"label\":\"Publishing\",\"icon\":\"icon-globe.svg\"},{\"label\":\"Pre-press & Print\",\"icon\":\"icon-plus-box.svg\"}]',12,'2026-10-13 06:54:51','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(195,'about-us','ab_reasons','07 Why Choose Us','Reasons to choose us','[{\"icon\":\"icon-users.svg\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Teams\",\"text\":\"Skilled professionals aligned with your workflows, brand guidelines and ongoing requirements.\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-briefcase.svg\",\"title\":\"Managed Services\",\"text\":\"End-to-end management of defined production activities, with structured processes and quality checks.\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-globe.svg\",\"title\":\"Scalable Capacity\",\"text\":\"The flexibility to manage recurring assignments, large-volume deliverables and fluctuations in workload.\"},{\"icon\":\"icon-clock.svg\",\"title\":\"Consistent Quality & Delivery\",\"text\":\"Standardised workflows, review mechanisms and clear communication to support dependable output.\"}]',16,'2026-10-13 06:54:51','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(208,'marketing-sales-collaterals','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your full name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email address\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-13 07:39:06','2026-10-13 07:39:06'),(209,'marketing-sales-collaterals','cl_related','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','Related service cards','[{\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"text\":\"We design logos that reflect your business and remain clear from large signage to small app icons. Each logo is supplied in practical versions and file formats for print and digital use.\",\"href\":\"logo-design\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"text\":\"We bring your logo, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system. The identity is designed to work across websites, packaging, business cards, print and digital touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts. Design and adaptation are handled with production requirements in mind, supporting a smooth transition from concept to press.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"text\":\"We develop the core campaign idea and creative direction before designing individual assets. The approved concept is carried across banners, video and social formats so the campaign feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"text\":\"We help shape how your business communicates with employees, customers, investors and the public. Strategy, messaging and supporting materials keep communication clear and consistent across audiences.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Visual Identity Systems\",\"text\":\"We unify colour, typography, imagery and graphic language into a system that works across websites, packaging, presentations and ads. Clear usage rules help keep the identity consistent as the business grows.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"text\":\"We structure and design presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication. Clear visual hierarchy helps the audience follow your message, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"text\":\"We bring strategy, creative, media planning and reporting together in one connected advertising process. Campaigns are planned, produced and measured against a shared objective.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes. The process covers websites, mobile apps and other digital products.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-13 07:39:06','2026-10-13 07:39:06'),(249,'case-study','cs_profile','Hero','Client box (hero)','[{\"title\":\"Client profile\",\"text\":\"UAE-based diversified business conglomerate with a growing network of businesses\"},{\"title\":\"Industries served\",\"text\":\"Diversified business conglomerate & investment group\"},{\"title\":\"Market reach\",\"text\":\"Stakeholders, partners and customers across multiple verticals\"}]',6,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(250,'case-study','cs_stats','Numbers','Headline numbers','[{\"title\":\"10\",\"text\":\"Services delivered\"},{\"title\":\"6\",\"text\":\"Approach initiatives executed\"},{\"title\":\"5\",\"text\":\"Core challenges addressed\"},{\"title\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Unified identity across every business vertical\"}]',10,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(251,'case-study','cs_highlights','01 Industry Overview','Key highlights','[{\"title\":\"Unified identity\",\"text\":\"One cohesive visual identity for the entire group.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate website\",\"text\":\"A modern website showcasing its diverse businesses.\"},{\"title\":\"Clear structure\",\"text\":\"Content structured to communicate multiple industry verticals clearly.\"},{\"title\":\"Consistent voice\",\"text\":\"Corporate presentations and social media aligned with the brand identity.\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(252,'case-study','cs_challenges','02 The Challenge','Challenges','[{\"title\":\"Fragmented experience\",\"text\":\"Diverse business verticals lacked a unified brand experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate positioning\",\"text\":\"The group needed stronger corporate positioning.\"},{\"title\":\"Complex offerings\",\"text\":\"Complex offerings required clearer digital communication.\"},{\"title\":\"Inconsistent communication\",\"text\":\"Communication was inconsistent across marketing touchpoints.\"},{\"title\":\"Limited storytelling\",\"text\":\"Limited social presence and brand storytelling.\"}]',30,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(253,'case-study','cs_approach','03 The Approach','Approach steps','[{\"title\":\"Visual identity\",\"text\":\"Developed a cohesive visual identity for the group.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate website\",\"text\":\"Designed a modern corporate website showcasing its diverse businesses.\"},{\"title\":\"Content structure\",\"text\":\"Structured content to clearly communicate multiple industry verticals.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate presentations\",\"text\":\"Created corporate presentations aligned with the brand identity.\"},{\"title\":\"Social media\",\"text\":\"Established a consistent social media presence and content direction.\"},{\"title\":\"Unified experience\",\"text\":\"Built a unified brand experience across digital and corporate touchpoints.\"}]',40,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(254,'case-study','cs_results','04 Results & Brand Outcomes','Outcomes','[{\"title\":\"Unified\",\"text\":\"One identity across every business vertical\"},{\"title\":\"Clear\",\"text\":\"Multiple industries communicated clearly online\"},{\"title\":\"Consistent\",\"text\":\"Aligned digital and corporate touchpoints\"},{\"title\":\"Focused\",\"text\":\"Diverse businesses brought into one clear story\"}]',50,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(255,'case-study','cs_services','06 Services Delivered','Services delivered','[{\"title\":\"Branding & Visual Identity\",\"text\":\"One cohesive group identity\"},{\"title\":\"Graphic Design & Marketing Collaterals\",\"text\":\"Corporate presentations and materials\"},{\"title\":\"Website Design & Development\",\"text\":\"Modern corporate website\"},{\"title\":\"Social Media Management\",\"text\":\"Consistent content direction\"},{\"title\":\"3D Product Texturing & Rendering\",\"text\":\"Product visuals\"},{\"title\":\"Lead Generation Strategy\",\"text\":\"Structured enquiry generation\"},{\"title\":\"SEO & Organic Visibility\",\"text\":\"Search presence for the group\"},{\"title\":\"Exhibition & Expo Support\",\"text\":\"Event materials\"},{\"title\":\"Product Photography\",\"text\":\"Professional product imagery\"},{\"title\":\"Product Explanation Videos\",\"text\":\"Clear product storytelling\"}]',60,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(256,'case-study','cs_capabilities','06 Services Delivered','Capabilities applied','[\"Corporate branding\",\"Visual identity\",\"Website experience\",\"Content structure\",\"Corporate presentations\",\"Social media\",\"SEO\",\"Photo & video\"]',70,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(261,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Brand Strategy &amp; Positioning\",\"Logo &amp; Identity Development\",\"Brand Guidelines &amp; Typography\",\"Branded Collateral &amp; Applications\"]',5,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:57:31'),(262,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"rollout\":\"Packaging Rollout & Product Range Extensions\",\"beauty\":\"Beauty & Skincare Pa