e team, with no freelancers or subcontracting.\"},{\"c\":\"#E31E36\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-2.png\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Design Team\",\"text\":\"The skilled designers work across your marketing materials, maintaining brand consistency without repeated briefing.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-3.png\",\"title\":\"Data Security & Confidentiality\",\"text\":\"Your marketing plans, sales materials and confidential business information are handled securely within our in-house team.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-4.png\",\"title\":\"Flexible & Transparent Pricing\",\"text\":\"Choose an engagement model that suits your design requirements, with the scope and pricing agreed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(266,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"]]',50,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(267,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Custom Packaging Design\",\"Packaging rollout\",\"Custom Box Packaging Design\",\"Product Label Design\",\"Packaging Concepts\",\"Brand Identity Integration\",\"Product Mockups & 3D Visualizations\"]},{\"title\":\"Packaging Rollout\",\"points\":[\"Approved artwork adapted across multiple SKUs\",\"Product variants and packaging formats\",\"Language and artwork localisation\"]},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"points\":[\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\"]}]',60,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 06:57:19'),(268,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_flow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"c\":\"#F6B700\",\"nx\":47.51,\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"iw\":296,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Discovery\",\"text\":\"Understand your products, packaging requirements, brand guidelines, production workflow, and project objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":212,\"title\":\"Design\",\"text\":\"Develop packaging concepts that balance creativity, functionality, and brand consistency.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"iw\":287.34,\"ih\":198.77,\"title\":\"Packaging Rollout\",\"text\":\"Adapt approved artwork across multiple SKUs, product variants, languages, and packaging formats.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"iw\":296,\"ih\":211,\"title\":\"Pre-Press\",\"text\":\"Validate artwork, refine technical specifications, and prepare accurate print-ready files.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"nx\":31.01,\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":217,\"title\":\"Delivery\",\"text\":\"Deliver production-ready artwork that supports faster approvals and efficient manufacturing.\"}]',70,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(269,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logodesign-eywucqqe.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-waucpo1f.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-5fpqglcp.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-3ddbasds.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-8lpjmbra.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Visual Identity Systems\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/visual-identity-systems-c6gdtvpm.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We unify colour, typography, imagery and graphic style, then define usage rules to keep every touchpoint consistent.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ppt-design-clgmui0a.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/advertising-services-3wgucctl.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We connect advertising strategy, creative, media and reporting so campaigns work toward a shared goal across platforms.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/uiux-design-fsywkyyf.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 07:57:35'),(270,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your brand identity design services?\",\"Our full system includes: your brand strategy and positioning, logo and a logo system, colour palette, typography, a photographic style and brand guidelines. We also go on to create the day-to-day stationery and collateral that your organisation uses.\"],[\"How long does it take to develop a complete brand identity?\",\"A full identity could take a matter of three to six weeks to design, depending on scale and number of items being designed for. Less detailed projects execute faster and are always preceded by mutually agreeable timelines, so you understand each part of the process.\"],[\"Do you offer brand identity design for startups as well as established companies?\",\"For startups, we will create it from zero; for established brands, we will build on what you have already got. That fits with your brand right where it is - whether that is a brand from scratch that just wants to get better at growing up or you have a grown-up brand that needs us for a specific project.\"],[\"What&#039;s the difference between a logo design and a full brand identity package?\",\"A logo is a single element. A brand identity consists of everything to do with that element: the brand colours, typefaces, graphics, and also voice and manner - all bundled up in identity guidelines. A logo is just another name for the company identity. A brand cannot be consistent unless there&#039;s a completely unified and comprehensive corporate identity.\"],[\"Can you redesign or refresh an existing brand identity (rebranding)?\",\"We provide rebranding services for everything from a simple update of your brand visuals to a comprehensive rebrand if your business has shifted to a new focus, starting by analyzing where your brand is already working well and where it isn\\u2019t.\"],[\"What are the tools that you use in building brand identity?\",\"Mainly the Adobe suite: Illustrator for logo systems and vector work, Photoshop for imagery, and InDesign for guidelines and print collateral, with Figma for digital templates. This keeps your identity consistent across both print and screen.\"],[\"Do you provide brand identity design services for international or multi-region businesses?\",\"We create identities ready to work across regions, languages, and markets - with guidelines that help make the brand look and feel coherent wherever it&#039;s used. Our approach to business branding can help if your company manages a single brand for different geographic locations and teams.\"]]',90,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 07:41:07'),(271,'brand-identity-and-design~work-kxzx','cl_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"brochures\":\"Brochures &amp; Catalogues\",\"sales\":\"Sales Collateral\",\"digital\":\"Digital Marketing Materials\"}',19,'2026-10-23 05:46:22','2026-10-23 05:46:22'),(272,'brand-identity-and-design~work-kxzx','cl_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/1-fi2ijjb6.webp\",\"cats\":\"brochures\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/2-oyywpina.webp\",\"cats\":\"sales\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/3-u6hxtq88.webp\",\"cats\":\"digital\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/4-nqihtlbn.webp\",\"cats\":\"brochures sales\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/5-p4wioucp.webp\",\"cats\":\"sales digital\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/6-ojzuqz43.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/7-dowxlgsf.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"},{\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/8-witmfsgw.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 05:46:22','2026-10-23 07:17:28'),(273,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Brand Identity Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house designers coordinate your brand identity from initial direction through guidelines and final asset delivery.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Strategy-Led Brand Systems\",\"text\":\"We manage your brand identity from initial creative direction to comprehensive brand guidelines and final asset delivery, ensuring consistency, clarity, and alignment with your business objectives at every stage\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Confidential Brand Asset Handling\",\"text\":\"The brand guideline documents, identity concepts, and source files files are developed, managed, and delivered through a structured workflow as per agreed timelines.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Deliverables list, QC process, Timelines and Pricing are mutually agreed before the project starts.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 06:08:59'),(274,'brand-identity-and-design~tools-xjvk','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-indesign-fwzwoxpp.svg\",null,\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-illustrator-gbdrqne6.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/figma-xkkwhxpp.svg\",null,\"Figma\",\"Design | Prototype\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-photoshop-m9aypmbq.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-after-effects-2fworxqf.svg\",null,\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Showcase\"]]]',50,'2026-10-23 05:48:45','2026-10-23 07:49:05'),(275,'brand-identity-and-design~services-scse','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Brand Foundation\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Brand discovery, positioning and personality\",\"A clear read on your audience and market\",\"Messaging, tone of voice and key brand statements\",\"Naming and tagline development where needed\"]},{\"title\":\"Visual Identity\",\"points\":[\"Logo and logo system design\",\"Colour palette and typography\",\"Imagery, iconography and graphic style\",\"Design rules for applying the identity consistently\"]},{\"title\":\"Brand Assets and Guidelines\",\"points\":[\"A complete brand guidelines document\",\"Business cards, stationery and corporate templates\",\"Social media and presentation templates\",\"Print and digital collateral built on the identity\"]}]',60,'2026-10-23 05:50:29','2026-10-23 06:36:07'),(276,'brand-identity-and-design~services-scse','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discovery\",\"text\":\"We get to know your business, your market and your audience, and agree what the brand needs to stand for.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Strategy and direction\",\"text\":\"We settle the brand&#039;s positioning, personality and tone, so every design choice has a clear reason behind it.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Visual identity design\",\"text\":\"We design the logo system, colours, typography and visual style, and share them for your review.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Refinement\",\"text\":\"We develop the direction you choose and refine each element until the identity holds together, within the agreed revision rounds.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Guidelines and assets\",\"text\":\"We document the identity in a guidelines file and produce the templates and collateral your team needs.\"}]',70,'2026-10-23 05:50:29','2026-10-23 06:36:45'),(278,'logo-design','pk_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Custom, Original Concepts\",\"Works at Every Size\",\"Files for Every Use\",\"Consistent Logo Variations\"]',5,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(279,'logo-design','pk_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"rollout\":\"Packaging Rollout & Product Range Extensions\",\"beauty\":\"Beauty & Skincare Packaging\",\"food\":\"Food & Beverage Packaging\",\"appliance\":\"Appliance & Electronics Packaging\"}',19,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51')